# In spite of the fact that in Russian: несмотря на то что, в связи с тем что
subtitle: "Несмотря на то что, благодаря тому что, из-за того что, в связи с тем что: how to join a whole clause to a preposition — as Tom tells Ольга he is leaving «Нева»."
tags: ["russian","несмотря на то что","russian conjunctions","complex sentences","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/linking-words","phrases/formal-register"]
thumb: "band \"In spite of the fact that… in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Russian proverbs: без труда, тише едешь","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/193-russian-proverbs.cast"}

