      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:jn3ut7'
    '|a||Из-за пого́ды. Из-за того́ что хо́лодно: того́, the of-colour. Из-за, usually for something bad.':
